 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>افزایش فروش</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>کاهش هزینه جذب</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بهبود UX</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-blue-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-blue-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trending-up h-6 w-6 text-blue-600\"><polyline points=\"22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17\"></polyline><polyline points=\"16 7 22 7 22 13\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">استراتژی محتوایی</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">تدوین تقویم محتوایی و استراتژی کلمات کلیدی بر اساس داده‌های واقعی.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>محتوای هدفمند</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>جذب مخاطب درست</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>ROI بالا</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 mb-4\">تحلیل رفتار کاربر</div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">درک عمیق <span class=\"gradient-text\">رفتار مشتریان</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">شناخت دقیق نیازها و رفتار کاربران برای ارائه بهترین تجربه کاربری</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">نقشه حرارتی و رفتار کاربر</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">تحلیل دقیق نقاط کلیک، اسکرول و رفتار کاربران در سایت.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>شناسایی نقاط داغ</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>رفع مشکلات UX</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بهینه‌سازی چیدمان</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">تحلیل سفر مشتری</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">ردیابی مسیر حرکت کاربر از ورود تا خرید و شناسایی نقاط ریزش.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>درک رفتار مشتری</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>بهبود مسیر خرید</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>افزایش وفاداری</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-purple-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-purple-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-brain h-6 w-6 text-purple-600\"><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 0-5.997.125 4 4 0 0 0-2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 0 .556 6.588A4 4 0 1 0 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 5a3 3 0 1 1 5.997.125 4 4 0 0 1 2.526 5.77 4 4 0 0 1-.556 6.588A4 4 0 1 1 12 18Z\"></path><path d=\"M15 13a4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3-4 4.5 4.5 0 0 1-3 4\"></path><path d=\"M17.599 6.5a3 3 0 0 0 .399-1.375\"></path><path d=\"M6.003 5.125A3 3 0 0 0 6.401 6.5\"></path><path d=\"M3.477 10.896a4 4 0 0 1 .585-.396\"></path><path d=\"M19.938 10.5a4 4 0 0 1 .585.396\"></path><path d=\"M6 18a4 4 0 0 1-1.967-.516\"></path><path d=\"M19.967 17.484A4 4 0 0 1 18 18\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">پیش‌بینی رفتار</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">استفاده از یادگیری ماشین برای پیش‌بینی نیازها و رفتار آینده کاربران.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>پیشنهاد هوشمند</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>شخصی‌سازی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>پیش‌بینی فروش</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 mb-4\">استراتژی و برندینگ</div><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">مدیریت برند و <span class=\"gradient-text\">مشاوره استراتژیک</span></h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">حفاظت از شهرت برند و تدوین نقشه‌راه هوشمند برای آینده کسب‌وکار</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-orange-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield h-6 w-6 text-orange-600\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">مانیتورینگ برند</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">نظارت ۲۴ ساعته بر نام برند شما در شبکه‌های اجتماعی و وب.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>مدیریت شهرت</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>شناسایی بحران</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>تحلیل احساسات</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-orange-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lightbulb h-6 w-6 text-orange-600\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path><path d=\"M10 22h4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">مشاوره استراتژیک AI</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">مشاوره تخصصی برای پیاده‌سازی هوش مصنوعی در فرایندهای کسب‌وکار.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>نقشه راه AI</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>اتوماسیون فرایند</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>تحول دیجیتال</div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg text-card-foreground hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group border-0 shadow-lg bg-white\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 pb-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-orange-200 transition-colors\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chart-line h-6 w-6 text-orange-600\"><path d=\"M3 3v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16\"></path><path d=\"m19 9-5 5-4-4-3 3\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"tracking-tight text-lg font-semibold\">تحلیل رقبا</h3></div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-0\"><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-4 leading-relaxed\">رصد مداوم فعالیت‌های رقبا و ارائه راهکارهای پیشی گرفتن از آنها.</p><div class=\"space-y-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>شناخت بازار</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>مزیت رقابتی</div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-gray-500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check-big h-4 w-4 text-green-500 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M21.801 10A10 10 0 1 1 17 3.335\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>تصمیم‌گیری بهتر</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-cyan-50\"><div class=\"container-custom\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6\">چرا به تحلیل و استراتژی <span class=\"gradient-text\">هوشمند</span> نیاز دارید؟</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">مزایای تصمیم‌گیری داده‌محور برای رشد پایدار</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4 p-6 bg-white/80 backdrop-blur rounded-xl border border-white/50 ho